gBirchSpeech_Welcome:: @ 81C6D78
	.string "Can you hear me? I am BIRCH.\p"
	.string "This place looks like HOENN, but\n"
	.string "physical land and digital code\p"
	.string "have collided.$"

gBirchSpeech_ThisIsPokemon:: @ 81C6DF8
	.string "Your DIGIMON crossed the glitch\n"
	.string "with you. Its signal is still\p"
	.string "alive.$"

gBirchSpeech_WorldInhabitedByPokemon:: @ 81C6E1A
	.string "You and your friend were pulled\n"
	.string "away from your own universe.\p"
	.string "The GYM BADGES here are DIGITAL\n"
	.string "KEYS. Collect all eight to\p"
	.string "unlock the gate home.\p"
	.string "Beyond that gate, the DARK\n"
	.string "MASTERS are sealing the breach.\p"
	.string "Face them together.$"

gBirchSpeech_AndYouAre:: @ 81C6FCB
	.string "The world is trying to rewrite\n"
	.string "your memories. Hold onto your\p"
	.string "real name.$"

gBirchSpeech_AreYouBoyOrGirl:: @ 81C6FD8
	.string "Your identity is intact. The\n"
	.string "glitch cannot erase who you are.$"

gBirchSpeech_WhatsYourName:: @ 81C6FFA
	.string "Your partner knows your signal.\n"
	.string "Remember the bond that brought\p"
	.string "you here.$"

gBirchSpeech_SoItsPlayer:: @ 81C7017
	.string "Your partner is calling,\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}. Will you answer?$"

gBirchSpeech_AhOkayYouArePlayer:: @ 81C7025
	.string "{PLAYER}, your friend is walking\n"
	.string "another path through this same\p"
	.string "broken world.\p"
	.string "Eight DIGITAL KEYS will lead you\n"
	.string "both to the gate at EVER GRANDE.$"

gBirchSpeech_AreYouReady:: @ 81C7074
	.string "Stay close to your partner. Find\n"
	.string "all eight DIGITAL KEYS.\p"
	.string "The familiar faces you meet may\n"
	.string "be echoes. Your friendship is\p"
	.string "real.\p"
	.string "Find me beyond LITTLEROOT. We\n"
	.string "will get you home.$"
